<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia confirms $508.5 mln July trade surplus.</title>
<headline>Indonesia confirms $508.5 mln July trade surplus.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia posted a trade surplus of $508.5 million in July, compared with $193.4 million in June, Information Minister Harmoko said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Following are the trade figures for July, in millions of dollars, with comparison for the previous month and a year earlier:</p>
<p>				July	 June     July 95</p>
<p>    Trade balance     +508.5     +193.4	+362.5</p>
<p>    Exports	    4,066.4    4,138.9     3,775.9</p>
<p>    Imports	    3,587.9    3,945.5     3,413.4</p>
<p>    Oil/gas exports    909.7	828.4	 824.7</p>
</text>
